        <body>
            <div xml:id="d894-a1">

                <pb facs="1039" n="959" sameAs="frus:frus1902/pg959"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Duke of Almodóvar del Rio to Mr.
                    Sickles.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Ministry of State</hi>, <hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Madrid</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1902-05-17"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">May 17,
                    1902</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Sir</hi>: It is with extreme satisfaction
                    that I announce to you that His Majesty the King my august sovereign, who has
                    arrived at his majority, has just taken oath to the constitution of the state in
                    the form prescribed by the fundamental law of Spain, and that the Spanish
                    Monarchy reigns from to-day.</p>
                <p>In giving you official news of such a memorable and happy event, I repeat the
                    assurance, etc.</p>
                <closer><hi rendition="#small-caps">The Duke of Almodóvar del Rio.</hi></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
